step The Writhing Deep
  tip The Zukk'ash hive burrows into the hills south-east of the camp; Stinglasher waits in its deepest chamber.
  collect 18961 quest 7730.1
  collect 18962 quest 7731.1 @75.6,60.9

step Ruins of Isildien: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip Ride west from the hive to the ogre ruins below Feral Scar Vale. Shamans, warlocks and maulers fill them; the Mage-Lords at the southern end carry the orb.
  kill 5234 quest 2980.3              -- Gordunni Mauler walks around Ruins of Isildien: look inside the circle on the map
  kill 5240 quest 2980.2
  kill 5236 quest 2980.1
  collect 9371 quest 2979.1

step Feral Scar Vale yetis
  tip North-west of the ruins, the yetis den in Feral Scar Vale; every yeti there can drop a thick hide.
  collect 8973 quest 2822.1

step Homing Robot OOX-22/FE
  tip Only with the distress beacon: any beast, gnoll or ogre in Feralas can drop it, about one kill in a hundred; use it to start the quest. The robot sits in a small cave on the north side of Feral Scar Vale, just north-west of the ruins. Escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in Booty Bay for a later visit.
  tip Careful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock.
  collect 8705 "OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon" optional
  accept 2766 optional
  turnin 2766 optional
  accept 2767 optional
  complete 2767 optional

